      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# dsh-pluginmgmt bundle patch: inserts the dual-face plugin row into the web\n# profile roster. Applied as a profile bundle layer (the dsh.bundle.patch\n# manifest field) over dsh-base.\n#\n# The node half (exports \".\") runs in the host process (plugin management\n# engine + /api/dsh-pluginmgmt routes + agent tools), and the dsh.client\n# declaration in package.json makes the browser half (exports \"./client\",\n# served at /plugins/dsh-pluginmgmt/client.js) load in the web GUI settings page.\n#\n# id is the row the user's own cordis.patch.yml toggles (keep it stable);\n# name is the published package name and must match package.json.\n- insert:\n    - id: ui-dsh-pluginmgmt\n      name: 'dsh-pluginmgmt'\n"
    }
